10. Key design warning (important)

Do NOT fall into this trap:

“Good enough tax assumptions + scraped housing data”

That will destroy credibility.

Your differentiator is:

deterministic tax modeling
clean census alignment
time-consistent housing indices

If those are wrong, the entire narrative collapses.

